#21711
Coastal Waters~
   The calm, shallow waters ripple softly as you make your way. Tiny schools
of fish pass by, darting around you and paying little attention. You cast your
gaze upon the ocean and rougher seas, stretching on over the horizon. The
relative safety of the coast lies close at hand, should you wish to dry off.
~
